7.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -47.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 계약기간 : 2009년 4월중 ～ 2009년 11월 30일(약 8개월)</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 보수 : 일급 38,000원 (시간외 근무수당 별도 지급)</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 근무시간 : 주 5일, 1일 8시간(09:00~18:00)</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 후생복지 : 건강보험, 고용보험, 산재보험, 국민연금 가입</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 근무지역&nbsp;: </font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">금오공과대학교</span></font></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;3. 응시자격 및 우대조건</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 응시연령 : 만 29세이하(1979.1.1 이후 출생한 자)</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 59.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -59.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">「제대